{"id":"a8","level":2,"levelName":"Ulpan Alef","n":15,"of":19,"title":"Asking","titleHe":"שְׁאֵלוֹת","goal":"Ask what, who, where, when, why and how much.","sections":[{"type":"text","body":"Question words go first, and nothing else in the sentence moves — Hebrew doesn't invert word order to ask."},{"type":"examples","items":[{"he":"מָה זֶה?","en":"What is this?"},{"he":"מִי הָאִישׁ?","en":"Who is the man?"},{"he":"אֵיפֹה הַסֵּפֶר?","en":"Where is the book?"},{"he":"מָתַי אַתָּה בָּא?","en":"When are you coming?"},{"he":"לָמָּה לֹא?","en":"Why not?"},{"he":"כַּמָּה זֶה עוֹלֶה?","en":"How much does it cost?"}]},{"type":"tip","body":"A yes-or-no question is just the statement with a rising tone. הַאִם can be put at the front in writing, but speech rarely bothers."}],"vocab":[{"he":"מָה","en":"what","translit":"ma"},{"he":"מִי","en":"who","translit":"mi"},{"he":"אֵיפֹה","en":"where","translit":"eifo"},{"he":"מָתַי","en":"when","translit":"matai"},{"he":"לָמָּה","en":"why","translit":"lama"},{"he":"אֵיךְ","en":"how","translit":"eich"},{"he":"כַּמָּה","en":"how much, how many","translit":"kama"},{"he":"אֵיזֶה","en":"which","translit":"eize"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["what","red","sees","influence"],"correct":0,"prompt":"מָה","translit":"ma"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["helps","coffee","who","drinks"],"correct":2,"prompt":"מִי","translit":"mi"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["noisy","where","hurts","twelve (f.)"],"correct":1,"prompt":"אֵיפֹה","translit":"eifo"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["old man, elder","fruit","desert, wilderness","when"],"correct":3,"prompt":"מָתַי","translit":"matai"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["why","happy","four (m.)","an ascent — immigration to the land"],"correct":0,"prompt":"לָמָּה","translit":"lama"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["how","right, privilege","these","hour, o'clock"],"correct":0,"prompt":"אֵיךְ","translit":"eich"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["how much, how many","early","saying (introduces speech)","luck, fortune"],"correct":0,"prompt":"כַּמָּה","translit":"kama"},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “where”?","options":["אֵיפֹה","קָצָר","פַּחַד","עוֹף"],"correct":0,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “how”?","options":["מִקְלֶדֶת","חֲגוֹרָה","דָּג","אֵיךְ"],"correct":3,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “how much, how many”?","options":["תּוֹצָאָה","כַּמָּה","נָעִים מְאֹד","דּוֹדָה"],"correct":1,"he":true},{"type":"read","he":"מִי","translit":"mi","en":"who"},{"type":"cloze","sentence":"מָתַי ___ בָּא?","en":"When are you coming?","options":["מָתַי","אַתָּה","אֵיךְ","כַּמָּה"],"correct":1,"full":"מָתַי אַתָּה בָּא?"},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["אֵיךְ","כַּמָּה","מִי","לָמָּה"],"correct":1,"say":"כַּמָּה","he":true},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["מָתַי","אֵיךְ","לָמָּה","אֵיזֶה"],"correct":3,"say":"אֵיזֶה","he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “which”?","options":["לַמְרוֹת","סַבְלָנוּת","דִּירָה","אֵיזֶה"],"correct":3,"he":true},{"type":"type","q":"Write “where” in Hebrew","answer":"אֵיפֹה","hint":"eifo"}]}